This is an application filed by the petitioner praying for grant of anticipatory bail in terms of sections 482 and 484 of Bharatiya Nagrik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, as the petitioner has been allegedly implicated in connection with Govindpur PS Case No.270 of 2023,
for the offences punishable under sections 406/ 420/417/467/471/34 of the Indian Penal Code,
pending in the court of learned Judicial Magistrate, 1st Class at Dhanbad.
